{"kind":"github_issue","repository":"microsoft/vscode-copilot-release","item":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/14124","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/14124/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/14124/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/14124/events","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/14124","id":3936833455,"node_id":"I_kwDOJYd5Dc7qp0-v","number":14124,"title":"Terminal tool drops commands after heredoc terminator","user":{"login":"Alain1405","id":2998545,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5OTg1NDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2998545?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alain1405","html_url":"https://github.com/Alain1405","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alain1405/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alain1405/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alain1405/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alain1405/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alain1405/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alain1405/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alain1405/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alain1405/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alain1405/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-02-13T12:03:43Z","updated_at":"2026-03-06T18:06:52Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Type\nBug\n\n## Description\nIn Copilot terminal tool execution, inline heredocs are parsed inconsistently. A standalone heredoc works, but when a second command is appended after the heredoc terminator, the trailing command is dropped (or the shell can end up in a continued prompt state).\n\nThis matches repeated behavior we saw in session with messages like: \"The terminal mangled the inline heredoc unexpectedly\".\n\n## Repro (minimal)\nRun this through Copilot terminal execution:\n\n```bash\npython - <<'PY'\nprint('first')\nPY\necho 'second'\n```\n\n## Expected\nBoth lines execute and output is:\n\n```text\nfirst\nsecond\n```\n\n## Actual\nOnly heredoc payload executes:\n\n```text\nfirst\n```\n\n## Control case (works)\n```bash\npython -c \"print('first')\"; echo 'second'\n```\nOutputs:\n```text\nfirst\nsecond\n```\n\n## Environment\n- OS: macOS 26.1 (25B78)\n- Shell: /bin/bash\n- Context: VS Code Copilot Chat terminal tool execution\n\n## Notes\n- Standalone heredoc (no trailing command) works.\n- Adding commands after heredoc terminator appears to trigger truncation/parsing loss in command dispatch layer.\n- We also observed occasional continued prompt state (`>`), suggesting delimiter handling can desync the terminal parser.\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/14124/reactions","total_count":10,"+1":10,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/14124/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null},"comments":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/4013209001","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/14124#is